graph TD
    A[Entry Details] --> B[Validate Entry]
    B -->|Invalid| ERR1[Return Error]
    B -->|Valid| C[Check Balance]
    C -->|Unbalanced| ERR2[Return Error]
    C -->|Balanced| D[Check Period]
    D -->|Closed| ERR3[Return Error]
    D -->|Open| E[Post Entry]
    E -->|Error| ERR4[Return Error]
    E -->|Success| F[Update Balances]
    F -->|Error| R1[Rollback Entry]
    F -->|Success| DONE[Entry Posted]

    style ERR1 fill:#f96
    style ERR2 fill:#f96
    style ERR3 fill:#f96
    style ERR4 fill:#f96
    style R1 fill:#f96
    style DONE fill:#9f9
